1
00:02:05,230 --> 00:02:08,564
我很欣慰你们都还是自己
I'm so glad the four of you are still the four of you.

2
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:11,647
在永恒仙境可不总是这么幸运
Not always the case in the Ever After.

3
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,605
是你先丢下我们不管的!
You're the one who ditched us in the first place!

4
00:02:14,814 --> 00:02:18,689
而且就是因为那样 我们才会跑到那个蘑菇屋里
Which, by the way, was how we ended up in that mushroom house to begin with.

5
00:02:19,105 --> 00:02:22,147
你知道 就是那个疯疯癫癫的毛毛虫男差点给我们下药的地方
You know, where that delirious caterpillar guy tried to drug us.

6
00:02:22,189 --> 00:02:25,439
然后他就被地上的大坑给吞掉了!
And then was swallowed up by a freaking hole in the ground!

7
00:02:25,689 --> 00:02:27,314
啊 是的 是的
Ah, yes, yes.

8
00:02:27,355 --> 00:02:32,064
爱丽克丝最开始看到有人轮回时跟你们的反应也是一样的
Alyx had a similar reaction the first time she saw someone return to the Ever After.

9
00:02:32,314 --> 00:02:33,689
但 这并不像是你们看到的那样
But it's not how it seems.

10
00:02:34,814 --> 00:02:36,147
嗯 其实的确是那样
Well, I supposed it is.

11
00:02:36,897 --> 00:02:40,230
但不是你们想的那样 如果你们跟爱丽克丝想的一样的话
But not the way you think, if you think like Alyx.

12
00:02:41,105 --> 00:02:42,272
你们似乎确实是那么想的
Which it seems like you'do.

13
00:02:49,022 --> 00:02:52,022
阿哈 我们到了!
Aha, we're here!

14
00:03:11,605 --> 00:03:12,314
赶紧来!
Better run!

15
00:03:17,522 --> 00:03:18,314
所以 猫猫啊...
So, cat...

16
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:24,855
你不打算跟我们解释一下大毛毛虫被大坑吞掉怎么不是我们想的那样了吗?
Going to explain to us how a giant caterpillar disappearing into a hole isn't how it seems?

17
00:03:27,022 --> 00:03:31,939
当我们损坏 或是被磨损 又或是完成了我们被赋予的任务 我们就会被召回
When we break, or wear out, or simply finish what we were made to do, we're called back.

18
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:36,147
但是Herb 他的内心不够强大
But Herb, his heart was too weak to listen.

19
00:03:36,855 --> 00:03:38,897
所以我把我的心分给了他一些
So I gave him a little bit of mine.

20
00:03:40,855 --> 00:03:43,022
他是. 死了吗?
Is he... dead?

21
00:03:43,272 --> 00:03:45,814
不不不!
No, no!

22
00:03:45,855 --> 00:03:47,314
嗯 可能算是有一点吧
Well, maybe a little bit.

23
00:03:47,897 --> 00:03:48,980
但又完全不是
But not at all.

24
00:03:49,105 --> 00:03:50,355
呃啊! 到底是怎样啊?
Ugh! Which is it?

25
00:03:51,022 --> 00:03:54,314
咳咳 现在Herb被正式地召回了
Ahem, now that Herb's properly returned,

26
00:03:54,355 --> 00:03:59,647
他会被修好 变回他还是自己时想要成为的那个样子
he'll be fixed up nice and made into the Herb he wanted to be when he was still Herb.

27
00:03:59,897 --> 00:04:02,355
然后他就会回来 寻找他的意义
Then he'll come back and find his purpose.

28
00:04:02,772 --> 00:04:06,147
或许跟之前一样 又或许是不同的
Could be the same as before, or maybe not.

29
00:04:07,564 --> 00:04:10,855
在Herb回来后 他还会记得任何事吗?
When Herb comes back, will he remember anything?

30
00:04:10,897 --> 00:04:14,689
哈哈哈 记得又有什么意义呢?
Hahaha, what would be the point of that?

31
00:04:16,647 --> 00:04:18,855
你们跟爱丽克丝真像
Just like Alyx, you lot.

32
00:04:19,147 --> 00:04:23,689
我知道 我知道 在你们的家乡 生灵... 呃... 会死亡
I know, I know, where you're from, things... Ugh... Die.

33
00:04:24,272 --> 00:04:26,147
但我们与你们不同
But we're just not like you at all.

34
00:04:26,730 --> 00:04:28,564
我们会飞升
We ascend.

35
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,730
Herb将会重新寻回生命的意义
Herb will have a purpose again.

36
00:04:32,397 --> 00:04:33,730
这不可能
That's impossible.

37
00:04:33,772 --> 00:04:35,730
任何东西都会消亡的
Things have to die some day

38
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:36,772
对吧?
Right?

39
00:04:37,147 --> 00:04:39,272
什... 天呐 当然不是!
Wha... Goodness, no!

40
00:04:40,230 --> 00:04:43,355
虽然我想的确有个生物...
Though I suppose there is a creature...

41
00:04:44,147 --> 00:04:48,522
呃 不不不 那不是现在这个情况下该聊的东西
Uh... No, no, that's not the sort of thing you talk about in polite company.

42
00:04:51,855 --> 00:04:55,105
来一块热乎乎刚刚新鲜出炉的泥巴饼干吧!
Get your hot, fresh, right out of the oven mud cookies!

43
00:04:52,105 --> 00:04:58,355
等等 所以在Herb身上发生的那件事... 国王也是那样吗?
Wait, so what happened to Herb... Is that what happened to the King?

44
00:04:58,022 --> 00:05:01,564
快来! 试试我们的泥巴饼干! 它们超好吃哦!
C'mon! Try our mud cookies! They are delicious!

45
00:05:01,814 --> 00:05:03,522
那时的情况非常令人难过
It was all verysad.

46
00:05:03,897 --> 00:05:06,855
红国王无法接受自己输给爱丽克丝的事实
The Red King couldn't cope when he lost to Alyx.

47
00:05:06,897 --> 00:05:08,314
整日哭哭啼啼的
A crying mess.

48
00:05:08,897 --> 00:05:11,730
但幸好 他被召回了 也被修复了
Thankfully, he was called back, and fixed up.

49
00:05:11,772 --> 00:05:14,230
现在 他就是你们所见过的那位王子呢
And now, he is the Prince you met.

50
00:05:14,272 --> 00:05:17,772
被修复?王子更糟糕啊
Fixed up? The Prince was worse.

51
00:05:18,064 --> 00:05:20,605
王子并不应该是友善的
The Prince isn't supposed to be nice.

52
00:05:20,855 --> 00:05:23,980
他的意义就是要玩游戏 并且获胜
He's meant to play the game, and win.

53
00:05:24,647 --> 00:05:25,980
用尽一切手段都要赢
No matter what.

54
00:05:26,814 --> 00:05:30,980
所以这就是他会作弊的原因 而红国王就不会
So that's why he cheats, when the Red King didn't.

55
00:05:31,605 --> 00:05:35,230
但这也无法解释为什么红王子那么刻薄
But that still doesn't explain why the Red Prince was so much meaner.

56
00:05:35,522 --> 00:05:40,022
嗯 在飞升后 王子并不会记得爱丽克丝的小把戏
Well, the Prince may not remember Alyx's deception, after ascending.

57
00:05:40,647 --> 00:05:43,189
但是心是不会遗忘的
The heart very rarely forgets.

58
00:05:44,272 --> 00:05:47,355
但是在书里并没有任何关于飞升的描述
But there was nothing about ascension in the story.

59
00:05:48,272 --> 00:05:49,022
当然没有啦!
Of course not!

60
00:05:49,064 --> 00:05:51,022
解释情况多无聊啊!
Exposition is terribly boring!

61
00:05:51,230 --> 00:05:55,105
就连现在的这段对话也是 整体来说 可太乏味了
Even this conversation was, on the whole, rather tedious.

62
00:05:56,064 --> 00:05:57,772
爱丽克丝会不会还有什么别的没写进书里
I wonder what else Alyx left out?

63
00:05:58,855 --> 00:06:04,689
制作变大芭菲我们需要愤怒藤蔓 一个大小合适的辣辣洋芋 狮鹫外羽上的毛球.
Well, to make a growgurt parfait, one needs a bush of grumpy ivy, a good sized spicy potato, the lint of a griffin's sweater...

64
00:06:05,105 --> 00:06:09,147
埃塞尔的龙与杂货应该有这些 店就在那边...
Ethel's Dragons and More should have that, which is right next to...

65
00:06:08,855 --> 00:06:11,147
我可记不住这么多
I'll never remember all of that.

66
00:06:11,980 --> 00:06:14,480
我可以去弄到这些材料
I can procure those.

67
00:06:14,522 --> 00:06:18,772
但是有一种我们需要的材料 只有第三层才有
But there's another ingredient we must have that's only available on the third level.

68
00:06:18,814 --> 00:06:21,022
需要一些矮妖精的鼻毛
Some nose hair from a leprechaun.

69
00:06:21,064 --> 00:06:22,439
臆呃!
Eww ugh!

70
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:26,355
要不你去拿那个 我去找剩下的东西?
What if you retrieve that while I'll go get the rest?

71
00:06:26,647 --> 00:06:28,855
好 好的... 我想可以
Sure. I...I guess so.

72
00:06:28,897 --> 00:06:29,814
完美!
Wonderful!

73
00:06:29,855 --> 00:06:32,272
去找茶壶女士 她会有的
Look for the teapot lady. She'll have it.

74
00:06:32,314 --> 00:06:34,064
好了去吧
Now off you go.

75
00:06:43,230 --> 00:06:44,564
我想我最好还是跟着那只猫吧
Guess I better go with the cat/

76
00:06:44,605 --> 00:06:47,980
不然它半路又被什么闪闪发光的门把手吸引注意力溜了
...so they don't get distracted by a shiny doorknob and never come back.

77
00:06:48,022 --> 00:06:48,939
我跟你一起去
I'll go with you.

78
00:06:49,439 --> 00:06:52,855
让我离什么鼻毛之类的东西越远越好 谢谢
Getme as far away as possible from any nose hairs, please.

79
00:06:53,147 --> 00:06:54,730
我跟你一起吧 Ruby
I'll go with you, Ruby.

80
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:59,189
行了小猫咪
Nice try, kitty.

81
00:07:00,647 --> 00:07:02,439
我们要跟你一起去
But, we're coming along.

82
00:07:19,022 --> 00:07:20,522
出发!
Onward!

83
00:07:31,147 --> 00:07:34,939
呃 茶壶女士... 茶壶女士...
Uh, teapot Lady... teapot Lady...

84
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:06,355
你对那个有兴趣吗?
Does that one interest you?

85
00:08:12,647 --> 00:08:13,272
我...
I...

86
00:08:13,314 --> 00:08:15,314
我以为再也找不到它了
I thought this was lost forever.

87
00:08:16,605 --> 00:08:17,689
你怎么会有的?
How do you have it?

88
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:24,022
没有任何事物 或任何人 是永远消逝了的
Nothing, no one, is ever truly lost.

89
00:08:31,314 --> 00:08:32,564
那么你呢?
And, what about you?

90
00:08:34,564 --> 00:08:36,022
你迷失了吗?
Are you lost?

91
00:08:37,022 --> 00:08:42,814
不 不 我只是... 我朋友们去别的地方了
No, no, I just... My friends went somewhere else.

92
00:08:44,647 --> 00:08:46,855
你一个人在做这些事?
You're doing this all alone?

93
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:53,272
Ruby 我觉得我们不该在这
Ruby, I don't think we're supposed to be here.

94
00:08:54,355 --> 00:08:57,397
你是她的向导吗 小家伙?
Are you her guide, little one?

95
00:08:58,397 --> 00:09:02,355
是的! Ruby是我的朋友 我想帮她回家
Yes! Ruby is my friend, and I wanna help her get home.

96
00:09:03,022 --> 00:09:05,814
虽然我不知道她家在哪 也不知道怎么去
Even though I don't know where that is or how to get there.

97
00:09:11,564 --> 00:09:16,189
你好像背负着一些很沉重的担子
You seem to be carrying a rather large burden with you.

98
00:09:17,939 --> 00:09:20,730
我没事 我可以解决
I'm fine, I can handle it.

99
00:09:22,355 --> 00:09:27,314
如果你改变了想法 你可以挑选任何一件你喜欢的装备
If you change your mind, you may choose any one of these you like.

100
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,355
并且放下身上的重担
And set your burden down.

101
00:09:37,980 --> 00:09:39,397
我已经有武器了.
I already have a weapon...

102
00:09:40,855 --> 00:09:41,647
至少之前有..
I did...

103
00:09:41,897 --> 00:09:44,605
而你现在却来到了这里
And yet, here you are.

104
00:09:45,355 --> 00:09:49,980
寻找你也不知道是什么的东西
Searching for something else that you do not even know.

105
00:09:59,314 --> 00:10:01,772
Ruby? Ruby!
Ruby? Ruby!

106
00:10:01,814 --> 00:10:04,897
Ruby?你在跟谁说话?
Ruby? Who are you talking to?

107
00:10:04,939 --> 00:10:06,897
你拿到鼻毛了吗?
Did you retrieve the nose hair?

108
00:10:06,939 --> 00:10:11,564
快来! 尝尝我们的泥巴饼干! 他们超好吃哦! 绝对不能错过!
C'mon! Try our mud cookies! They are delicious! You don' wanna miss it!

109
00:10:09,939 --> 00:10:14,105
呃 没有 还没找到 但是
Uh, no, not just yet. But...

110
00:10:14,397 --> 00:10:17,189
拜托 Ruby 我们都拿到其他的材料了
Ruby, come on, we got everything else.

111
00:10:18,064 --> 00:10:20,522
我 呃... 抱歉
I uhh... I'm sorry.

112
00:10:21,939 --> 00:10:23,480
那是茶壶女士吗?
Is that the teapot lady?

113
00:10:23,814 --> 00:10:26,397
绝对是你吃过的最好吃的泥巴饼干!
Best mud cookies you've ever had!

114
00:10:26,772 --> 00:10:29,772
欢迎来到小物杂货店!
Welcome to Figgles and Things!

115
00:10:29,814 --> 00:10:31,772
有什么能帮到您的吗?
How can I help you?

116
00:10:32,189 --> 00:10:33,730
我们在找鼻毛
Looking for nose hairs.

117
00:10:33,772 --> 00:10:35,897
不 不是巨怪的
No, not the oger ones.

118
00:10:41,897 --> 00:10:43,897
好耶 是庆典!
Woohoo, a festival!

119
00:10:45,064 --> 00:10:47,814
伽卜沃克! 是伽卜沃克!
Jabberwalker! It's the Jabberwalker!

120
00:10:47,855 --> 00:10:49,522
那看来不是庆典
Or not.

121
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:57,355
等等 拜托了 我们需要这些矮妖精的鼻毛
Wait, please, we need those leprechaun nose hairs!

122
00:10:57,397 --> 00:10:59,355
没时间了!
No time!

123
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:03,272
这样 这个给你
Here, I'll give you this.

124
00:11:03,314 --> 00:11:06,230
这带着一个母亲的承诺
It carries a mother's promise.

125
00:11:08,939 --> 00:11:09,814
拿走!
Take it!

126
00:11:10,064 --> 00:11:12,564
这真的很糟
This is exceedingly bad.

127
00:11:12,605 --> 00:11:14,772
等等 伽卜沃克是什么?
Wait, what's a Jabberwalker?

128
00:11:14,814 --> 00:11:16,772
那是个非常糟糕的生物
It's a truly terrible creature.

129
00:11:16,814 --> 00:11:21,605
如果伽卜沃克吃掉了我们 我们就没法飞升了
If the Jabberwalker eats one of us, we do not ascend.

130
00:11:21,855 --> 00:11:23,814
要怎么做那个什么芭菲?
How do we make the parfait thing?

131
00:11:25,230 --> 00:11:26,564
把东西都扔进来!
Toss everything in here!

132
00:11:26,772 --> 00:11:30,022
但是 小心点 吃太多的话我们又得把你缩小了
But, be careful, eat too much and we'll have to shrink you back again.

133
00:11:30,064 --> 00:11:32,814
缩小药水跟这个是完全不同的配方
And that's a completely different potion

134
00:11:40,897 --> 00:11:41,772
还不够
It wasn't enough.

135
00:11:45,730 --> 00:11:48,980
寻找 禁锢 撕裂 屠杀
Find. Trap. Rip. Kill.

136
00:11:59,022 --> 00:11:59,814
不!
No!

137
00:12:07,522 --> 00:12:10,564
猎物 进食 咬碎
Prey. Eat. Devour.

138
00:12:13,355 --> 00:12:13,980
快跑!
Run!

139
00:12:14,022 --> 00:12:15,189
他在这里做什么?
What's he doing here?

140
00:12:15,230 --> 00:12:18,397
我给他找了点事做 趁现在 赶紧去!
I gave him something new to do for the moment, now, go!

141
00:12:18,772 --> 00:12:22,605
你的朋友们必须变大 不然我们就都要变成伽卜沃克的晚餐了!
Your friends need to get big again, or we're Jabberwalker dinner!

142
00:12:47,397 --> 00:12:48,772
是锈迹骑士!
It's the rusted knight!

143
00:12:48,814 --> 00:12:50,355
去拿芭菲!
Get the parfait!

144
00:12:58,647 --> 00:13:00,022
啊 终于好了!
Ah, finally!

145
00:13:04,772 --> 00:13:06,647
Ruby!跟着我!
Ruby! Follow me!

146
00:13:26,772 --> 00:13:30,522
我都说了 我跟你的事还没完呢!
I said I wasn't done with you yet!

147
00:13:43,397 --> 00:13:44,439
Neo?
Neo?

148
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:44,730
哈?
Huh?

149
00:13:49,689 --> 00:13:52,147
什么?应该只有一个的
What? There's only supposed to be one.

150
00:13:59,689 --> 00:14:00,147
什么?
What?

151
00:14:01,355 --> 00:14:02,147
快走!
Run!

152
00:14:03,772 --> 00:14:04,689
这边!
This way!

153
00:14:08,647 --> 00:14:09,564
Ruby 快来!
Ruby, come on!

154
00:14:09,772 --> 00:14:10,314
走了!
Go!

155
00:14:11,230 --> 00:14:12,605
我们会拖住它们的!
We'll hold them off!

156
00:14:59,064 --> 00:15:02,564
我不想再看到一个地方变为废墟了
I am so tired of leaving places in ashes.

157
00:15:16,272 --> 00:15:17,397
真是不敢相信
I can't believe it.

158
00:15:17,855 --> 00:15:20,439
是真正的锈迹骑士!
The Rusted Knight, in person

159
00:15:23,355 --> 00:15:25,314
Juniper 你做得很好
You did good, Juniper

160
00:15:30,605 --> 00:15:31,480
RWBY小队
Team RWBY.

161
00:15:34,147 --> 00:15:35,397
你们终于到了
You finally made it.